  "bio": "Agata Haindl is a highly accomplished tattoo artist specializing in black and gray styles, based in Zurich, Switzerland. With a focus on professionalism, Agata ensures that each session at the studio on Weinbergstrasse is not only about creating art but also about providing a top-notch, respectful service that adheres to the highest standards. Clients are invited to arrange appointments to experience Agata's expertise in a welcoming and professional environment."
